References
----------

These projects were read as references. No code is copied from them;
docs/prior-art.md says what each one taught us:

- kidctl (MIT) - https://github.com/kidctl/kidctl
- TestDPC (Apache-2.0) - https://github.com/googlesamples/android-testdpc
- Headwind MDM Android agent (Apache-2.0) - https://github.com/h-mdm/hmdm-android

If code is ever adapted from one of them, its copyright and license notice is
kept in the adapted file and listed here. Nothing is taken from GPL or AGPL
projects.


Dependencies
------------

The Android agent depends on the libraries in android/gradle/libs.versions.toml,
which are Apache-2.0 and are not redistributed as source.

The server depends on the npm packages in server/package.json (Hono, the MCP
TypeScript SDK, better-sqlite3, Zod, @node-rs/argon2, qrcode) and theirs, under
MIT, ISC and BSD licenses. The Docker image includes them with their own
license files.
